          </p>

          <p>
            We included both gas and battery mowers, and we have been blunt about where battery power falls short. Good battery mowers now mulch well, but the cheaper ones still struggle, and mulching shortens runtime more than most buyers expect. If you are deciding between power sources, our <a href="/best-gas-lawn-mowers/">best gas lawn mowers</a> and <a href="/best-electric-lawn-mower/">best electric lawn mower</a> guides cover each in more depth.
          </p>

          <p>
            Finally, we weighed what mulching actually requires from the owner. No mower mulches well if the grass is too long, too wet or cut with a dull blade, so this guide spends as much time on those habits as on the machines.
